# Frontend authentication

Read `docs/auth-frontend.md` before adding login/signup/verify UI.

- Call the API only through `apps/web/app/lib/api.ts` with `credentials: 'include'`.
- Never read, decode, or store the JWT. It is an HTTP-only `auth_token` cookie.
- Never send `Authorization: Bearer`.
- Public routes: `/login`, `/signup`, `/verify-email`. Everything else waits on `GET /api/auth/me`.
- JSON is camelCase. User ids are integers.
- No forgot-password, OAuth, or refresh-token UI.
- Do not put `SMTP_*`, `JWT_SECRET`, or `PYAI_*` in Vite env.
- Do not add auth unit/UI tests until explicitly requested.
